158
00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.970
Eesti laste luulet.

159
00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:25.370
Aga armas Olivia,
kuidas te ennast täna tunnete?

160
00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:28.970
No mulle tundub,
